.portrait-footer.manage-footer
  - manage_nav_items.each do |ctrl, path, icon, label_key|
    = link_to path do
      .league-link{ class: "link-active-#{params[:controller] == ctrl}" }
        .league-link-icon= image_tag(icon)
        .league-link-text= t(label_key)

:javascript
  $(document).ready(function() {
    var active = document.querySelector('.manage-footer .link-active-true');
    if (active && active.scrollIntoView) {
      active.scrollIntoView({ inline: 'center', block: 'nearest' });
    }
  });
